## Why This Is Asked

Tests cross-tenant governance, external collaboration, and how to enforce least privilege with scalable delegation. It also probes how to combine Lighthouse, B2B, PIM, CA, and auditing for a measurable, auditable workflow.

## Key Concepts

- Azure Lighthouse delegation model across tenants
- B2B collaboration and identity management
- Granular RBAC scoping (subscription, resource group, resource)
- Time-bound access with PIM or entitlement packages
- Conditional Access and MFA enforcement
- Auditing, monitoring, and threat detection (Azure Activity Logs, Sentinel)
- Sandbox testing and rollback strategies

